fsdb-helper-v2 (cmux's windowed FSDB helper, from helper-v2) contains third-party code.
Licence texts: GPL-3.0 in ../LICENSE (VaporView's, copied from upstream); MIT in
third_party/node-addon-api/LICENSE.md and third_party/node-api-headers/LICENSE.

- addon/fsdb_reader.cpp: VaporView's src/fsdb_reader.cpp at 59107c6, unmodified apart from
  a two-line licence header. VaporView: Lloyd Ramseyer (GitHub Lramseyer) and contributors,
  https://github.com/Lramseyer/vaporview, GPL-3.0. build.sh compiles it on the host together
  with the cmux additions addon/*.inc and addon/deval.h (GPL-3.0, as VaporView).
- helper.js, worker.js, expr.js, text.js, build.sh, cmux-helper-v2.sh: cmux's helper-v2,
  distributed with the GPL-3.0 code above.
- formats.js: generated by helper-v2's formats/build-formats.mjs (esbuild) from VaporView's
  webview sources riscv_disasm.ts, value_alias.ts, value_format.ts and value_search.ts as
  changed by cmux (source/cmux-vaporview.patch; the RISC-V disassembler and alias tables are
  cmux's additions), GPL-3.0. Its first lines name the vaporview-cmux commit it was built from.
- third_party/node-addon-api: node-addon-api headers, MIT (Node.js API collaborators).
- third_party/node-api-headers: Node-API headers, MIT (Node.js).
- Not redistributed: Synopsys Verdi's FSDB reader library, linked on the host from its
  Verdi install.
